### POST request
POST http://localhost:3000/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "NEW TASK!!!"
}
### GET tasks
GET http://localhost:3000/tasks

### GET tasks with id
GET http://localhost:3000/tasks/4

### PUT request
PUT http://localhost:3000/tasks/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Task done 👌",
  "done": "True"
}

### DELETE request
DELETE http://localhost:3000/tasks/4